.TH NEO-CAMERA 1 "2026-11-12" "gnome-phone 0.1.4" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-camera \- camera for GNOME Phone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-camera
.SH DESCRIPTION
LineageOS's Aperture rebuilt in GTK 4 on libcamera and GStreamer. Photos are saved as JPEG with EXIF to
.IR ~/Pictures/Camera ,
videos as H.264 and AAC MP4 to
.IR ~/Videos/Camera ;
the scan mode reads barcodes (GStreamer's zxing element). The cameras, their facing and rotation come from libcamera,
the flash from the LED class, and the video encoder from a measurement of the ones GStreamer has. It is D-Bus
activatable as de.yesman.Camera; its settings are GSettings de.yesman.Camera.
.SH SEE ALSO
gst-launch-1.0(1)
